## CLUSTER 1: Nail Infections (Highest priority, highest monetization)

**Q1.**
What's the real difference between how a fungal toenail infection looks and feels versus paronychia (bacterial) or nail psoriasis? A lot of readers assume any discolored or lifting nail is "fungus," so what should actually make someone suspect something else?

**Q2.**
